      "author": "Advancing Analytics",
      "summary": "This month: Databricks' Data + AI Summit owned the news cycle, so we're going deep on DAIS 2026!\n\nGenie graduates from a product to a family, with One, Agents, and the real story underneath: Genie Ontology, the context layer Databricks reckons is the actual bottleneck for enterprise AI. \n\nUnity AI Gateway goes GA, so governance can official shift from \"who can access this data\" to \"what can an agent actually do with it\", + runtime governance for the agent era. \n\nPlus Customer Lake bringing the agentic CDP inside the Lakehouse, Omnigent's move into open-source orchestration, and a quick word on GLM 5.2. This is your June AA AI Round-Up!\n\nCheck out the AI DAIS livestream: https://youtube.com/live/FkVHk0g7Xi4?feature=share",
